dget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tab_content\"><div class=\"content_row row container-inner vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid default-style default\"><div class=\"content_row_wrapper \"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"rt_heading_wrapper \"><h4 class=\"rt_heading \">What This Product Does:-<\/h4><\/div><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h4>Flexible:-<\/h4><p>Choose to plug in up to five Ethernet or Fast Ethernet devices and mix in up to four IEEE802.3af\/at IP-based devices like wireless access points or IP-based network surveillance cameras. Place these IEEE802.3af\/at-compliant devices where they belong \u2013 high up on walls and ceiling for maximum coverage \u2013 or anywhere else you need them. Power and data are carried over standard Cat 5 cabling.<\/p><h4>Plug and Play:-<\/h4><p>The standards-based PoE Switch senses and adjusts for network speed and cabling type automatically, for easy integration into your existing 10\/100 Ethernet network. For PoE, the switch automatically detects IEEE802.3af\/at-compliant devices, and supplies power as needed. Front panel LEDs keep you informed of switch and PoE status.<\/p><h4>Quiet and Compact:-<\/h4><p>Engineered for compact convenience, it durable metal case that is easily positioned on your desktop or a wall, using the included mounting hardware. The fan-less design quietly integrates with your small office environment.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7f033b7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7f033b7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" id=\"specifications\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"